  "label": "The elderly Black man is mapped as a 'sleepyhead'",
  "description": "The text 'sleepyhead' is overlaid on the image of the elderly Black man, creating an analogical mapping where the man is being labeled or identified as a 'sleepyhead'. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it projects the stereotype of laziness onto the visual subject, reinforcing the 'lazy/unemployed characterizations' anti-Black stereotype. The term 'sleepyhead' is used condescendingly, and the man's weary expression is juxtaposed with the text to amplify the insult.",
